name: Owned study preserves independent local dispatch, external findings refresh and operator Stop
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dispatcher_liveness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: campaign held-liveness-context
require-live-snap: 25 Jobs: 1 | approved-context
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | owned-context-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dispatcher_liveness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME admitted
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 LOGS | independent-local-origin
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity true
submit: run sbom-scan:scan
require-live-snap: 30 sbom-scan: 1 component | independent-local-result
require-live-snap: 20 LOGS | independent-local-return
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dispatcher_liveness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME local-completed
ask: Does the explicit local inventory finish and return to Logs while the separately approved one-job study remains running, without delaying the command until study exit or creating more study jobs?
type: Held draft λ
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dispatcher_liveness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME import
require-live-snap: 20 1 finding | external-ledger-refreshed
expect: LOGS
expect: Held draft λ
resize: 160x48
live-snap: refreshed-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: refreshed-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: refreshed-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: refreshed-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: refreshed-40x12
expect: Held draft λ
ask: Does the external observation appear during the held study without manual refresh, losing the draft or changing focus, with visible cancellation controls across terminal sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dispatcher_liveness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME stopped
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+C exit | operator-stopped-study
expect: Stopped by operator: 0 completed, 1 parked
expect-not: Review the recorded failure and current source
expect: Held draft λ
expect: 1 finding
ask: Does operator Stop cancel only the admitted fixed attempt, preserve its unresolved accounting and the external observation, and keep the draft without launching queued work?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit-with-held-draft
expect: no active work
expect: command draft
ask: Does the idle exit confirmation identify the held unsaved command draft, offer Stay as the default and leave disposal to an explicit exit choice?
keys: y
require-exit: 10
